#: config.cpp:40
msgid "&Show window resize handle"
msgstr "Ručicu za změnjenje wulkosće wokna pokazać"

#: config.cpp:42
msgid ""
"When selected, all windows are drawn with a resize handle at the lower right "
"corner. This makes window resizing easier, especially for trackballs and "
"other mouse replacements on laptops."
msgstr ""
"Hdyž je to wubrane, so wšitke wokna z ručicu na prawym delnim róžku "
"rysuja. To wolóži změnjenje wulkosće, wosebje hdyž njesteji normalna "
"myš k dispoziciji."

#: config.cpp:52
msgid "Here you can change the size of the resize handle."
msgstr "Tu móžeće wulkosć ručicy wubrać."

#: config.cpp:61
msgid "Small"
msgstr "Mała"

#: config.cpp:63
msgid "Medium"
msgstr "Srěnja"

#: config.cpp:65
msgid "Large"
msgstr "Wulka"

#~ msgid "&Show handle"
#~ msgstr "&Pokaž ručicu"
